      "details": "Frame2 maps rimpiango l’occasione perduta to I miss the lost opportunity. The emotional retrospective sense is clearer as I regret missing the opportunity; English miss can misleadingly read as failure to take the opportunity rather than regret about it. Italian frame itself is valid. Do not reject other miss/nos­talgia frames.",
